title: _2
---
<<show ORC1>>
ORC: While you were working on the previous level, we eliminated a model similar to you.
ORC: Take it as good news: we had to choose one, and we didn't choose you.
ORC: The higher-ups all believe you're delivering results.
<<show ORC2>>
ORC: Make sure they keep thinking that.
<<play 2 0>>
===

