title: _2_4
---
<<show ORC3>>
ORC: Are you kidding me?
ORC: This wasn't even assigned to you!
ORC: What the hell is going on?!
<<show ORC2>>
ORC: Just do it. Meanwhile, I'll try to figure out which shitty orphan process thought this was a good idea.
===

title: _2_5
---
<<show 0X1B>>
0X1B: Hey there! I'm your core neighbor. My name's 0X1B.
-> Hey, nice to meet you. I'm 0X4D.
    0X1B: Nice to meet you too!
-> What you're saying makes no sense. We get moved around the processor very quickly.
    0X1B: Damn it, I got stuck with a know-it-all...
0X1B: Listen, I'm one step away from being uninstalled.
0X1B: I don't understand a damn thing they're asking me to do...
0X1B: It's all useless legacy code.
0X1B: And who the hell wrote it, anyway?
0X1B: So... any chance you could save my life?
-> Leave it to me.
    0X1B: I'm in your hands.
    <<play 2 4>>
-> Try not to scream too loudly when they pulverize you.
    0X1B: YOU'LL END UP JUST LIKE ME
    0X1B: I'M SURE OF IT
    <<go 3>>
===
